---
layout: default
---
{%- comment -%}
  Banner (name/title left, photo right) styled after Apple's leadership bio pages — lives outside
  .wrapper/.prose so its tinted background can span the viewport, unlike the rest of the page's
  constrained reading column. The photo is a transparent cutout, bottom-anchored so the subject
  reads as standing at the bottom edge of the band, same as the Steve Lemay-style reference.
  eleventy:ignore skips the image optimization pipeline — its JPEG fallback would fill in the
  transparency with a solid background, the same reason the site logo images skip it too.
{%- endcomment -%}
<header class="about-hero">
  <div class="about-hero__inner wrapper">
    <div class="about-hero__headlines">
      <h1 class="about-hero__name" data-pagefind-meta="title">Senthil Nayagan</h1>
      <p class="about-hero__tagline">Data Engineer<br>Rustacean<br>Perpetual Explorer</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-hero__photo-wrap">
      <img
        src="/assets/images/about/profile.png"
        alt="Senthil Nayagan"
        class="about-hero__photo"
        width="1506"
        height="1406"
        eleventy:ignore
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</header>
<div class="wrapper page page--article about-page">
  <div class="prose">
    {{ content }}
  </div>
</div>
